  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-BILLA-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I told him about the Dream Water Treaty, he did not care. And then Judge Nelson sided with him and they both took the Cabins hostage.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Koala_JudgeF_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Superior_Judge_Rozzer_WL-BILLA_027.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1608179,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-BILLA-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Normally, I'd just storm in there, rangs a-boomin'. But he's gold class, so the handbook says \"discretion.\"",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Koala_JudgeF_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Superior_Judge_Rozzer_WL-BILLA_028.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1608179,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-BILLA-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Besides, Nelson knows all our tricks, but not yours. This has gone too far. Break into the Cabins and bring down Cane.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Koala_JudgeF_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Superior_Judge_Rozzer_WL-BILLA_029.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1608179,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-BILLA-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Soft touch? Me? I'll kick him in the eye. At least you got the hostages safe. This is why I don't care about politics. Just the law.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Koala_JudgeF_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Superior_Judge_Rozzer_WL-BILLA_030.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1608179,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-BILLA-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Yeah, no, yeah, good point, Wizard. Can't have one without the other. *Sigh* Okay, okay, let's put our heads together here.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Koala_JudgeF_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Superior_Judge_Rozzer_WL-BILLA_031.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1608179,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-BILLA-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Way I see it: Wallaru has no economy without selling the dream, as it were. But some people's dreams shouldn't be fulfilled.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Koala_JudgeF_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Superior_Judge_Rozzer_WL-BILLA_032.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1608179,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-BILLA-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Townies and Drovers both make good points, both act like idiots sometimes. So the solution would seem to be...",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Koala_JudgeF_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Superior_Judge_Rozzer_WL-BILLA_033.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1608179,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-BILLA-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "...Explosions? Ah?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Koala_JudgeF_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Superior_Judge_Rozzer_WL-BILLA_034.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1608179,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-BILLA-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "In this rare instance, I fear explosions are not the answer. The monsters you face are your reflections; you must find a way to improve what you see.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Joan_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Joan_Locke_WL-BILLA_077.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1608167,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-BILLA-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "With violence! No, no, not violence. The other one. Talking? In the neutral Wobbegong. You bring the Drovers, Ms. Locke. I'll take the Wizard.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Koala_JudgeF_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Superior_Judge_Rozzer_WL-BILLA_035.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1608179,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-BILLA-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I don't know if I'm up for this, Wizard. Negotiations are delicate, careful things. Feels like you brought a hammer to knit a sweater.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Koala_JudgeF_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Superior_Judge_Rozzer_WL-BILLA_036.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1608179,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
